cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |
  FrameMatter extends SpektraLab, originally developed by Hanze Qiu,
  and builds on Andrea Volpato's spektrafilm model. Cite spektrafilm
  for the film science and measured profiles; credit SpektraLab for the
  original application and native engine port. This repository adds grain,
  date-back, film-border, grayscale dust/fiber controls and full-width 135.
title: "FrameMatter: a macOS film and print simulation application"
authors:
  - name: "LittleSixNine"
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LittleSixNine/FrameMatter"
url: "https://github.com/LittleSixNine/FrameMatter"
keywords:
  - "film emulation"
  - "photography"
  - "Metal"
  - "macOS"
